### Get all lists
GET http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists

### Get one list
GET http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists/1

### Create a list
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "weekend", "overallPrice": 120.5, "userId": 1}

### Create with a missing name (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "utility", "overallPrice": 10, "userId": 999}